  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Owen's Pocket Journal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Owen's Pocket Journal
  content: 'Things I Learned on the Road


    Every village says their bread is
    the best.

    Farmers wake up earlier than anyone else.

    Mechanics somehow
    smell like oil even after washing.

    Librarians are surprisingly competitive
    about tea.

    Travelers always complain about the weather...

    no matter
    what the weather actually is.


    Maybe that''s just part of traveling.'
